					"Auni"
				],
				"points": [
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							1648.494,
							213.477,
							9656.33
						],
						"pointId": 11564
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							1651.032,
							213.487,
							9656.428
						],
						"pointId": 360700011
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							1650.233,
							213.48,
							9657.646
						],
						"pointId": 360700069
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 760240201,
					"content": "#Wow, you were way stronger than those big guys, {NICKNAME}. I guess size isn't everything!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240202,
					"content": "#Hehe, right? {NICKNAME}'s not the tallest person ever, but {M#he}{F#she} can thrash monsters ten times {M#his}{F#her} size, easy!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240203,
						760240205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240203,
					"content": "Oh, please, I just dabble. Paimon's the real thrasher.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240204
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760240204,
					"content": "Eh—!? Umm, flattery won't get you... W—Well, it might get you... half Paimon's share next time we eat something nice, how's that sound?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240206,
					"content": "#Then you can kick the Weasel Thief Big Bosses out of Moleyvalley, right, {NICKNAME}? This isn't their home, but they're always making a mess of it anyway.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240207,
					"content": "Funerals that should have been held can't be, and Grandpa Moley might've gotten killed because of them, too. But if we're going to hold new funerals, we'll have to find all of them first.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240208,
					"content": "Huh!? Did Weasel Thieves really... Also, can Paimon ask... When you say funerals, do you mean that people want to hold them here? Why here, of all places...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240209,
					"content": "Of course they do. I've made all the preparations, and I've thought of what songs to sing, too. Here, have a look — but do be quiet. Let him rest quietly.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240210,
					"content": "Auni takes a small matchbox from her pocket and opens it. A beautifully-colored beetle lies on a flowery lining cloth within. There are even a few white petals adorning the scene...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240211
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760240211,
					"content": "He's gone to his eternal rest, so we've got to hold a funeral for him. But all the places I picked are those small hills with machines on 'em, and they've all been occupied by Weasel Thieves.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240212,
					"content": "If Grandpa Moley's family haven't fled by now, they're probably dead. That's how badly the Weasel Thieves destroyed their home.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240213,
					"content": "#({NICKNAME}, do you think this \"Grandpa Moley\" guy she talks about is actually...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240214,
						760240216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240214,
					"content": "(Some sort of small animal, I suspect.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240215
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760240215,
					"content": "(Yeah, Paimon thinks so too. Probably an animal friend of hers.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240218,
					"content": "Hmm. How about we help you catch these no-good, evil-doing Weasel Thieves? And as for Grandpa Moley's family... We can look for them once we've brought those thieves to justice. How's that sound?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240219,
					"content": "Huh. You're real good people, you two. I'll invite you to the funeral for sure.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240220,
					"content": "Well, you don't have to do that, exactly...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240221,
					"content": "Okay. In that case, you can have the sugar sculpture I bought earlier— Huh, I guess it's already gone.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240222,
					"content": "Well, I've still got the pocket money Jurva gave me — you can take that and buy some sugar sculptures for yourselves.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240223,
					"content": "If you ask people for help, you gotta repay 'em, and you gotta say thanks. That's the right way to do things.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240224,
						760240226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240224,
					"content": "Ah, Paimon. To think you would seize candy from the tiny hands of children...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240225
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760240225,
					"content": "Hang on! Why're you making Paimon out to be some kinda villain? Still, you're super polite for a little kid, Auni.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240227,
					"content": "Thanks! But you're each getting enough Mora for only one sugar sculpture. Buttering me up won't get you any extra.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240228,
					"content": "And then you're surprisingly practical about things like this... It seems like we're dealing with more than one weaselly Weasel Thief, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240229,
					"content": "Yup, that's right. The one that ran off just now isn't the Weasel Thief Big Boss I saw before. In fact, I've got no clue how many brothers he has.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240230,
					"content": "But you can find the same robo-claws that fire bullets over there, so we might also find more Weasel Thieves there, too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240231,
					"content": "Alright. We're not letting those Weasel Thieves get away this time. We're gonna teach 'em a lesson!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240226,
					"content": "An admirable sense of decorum indeed.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240227
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760240216,
					"content": "(It could be someone who used to live here.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240217
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760240217,
					"content": "(Huh? But this place doesn't look like it's had any long-term residents... It's probably one of her animal friends instead! She even does funerals for beetles, after all.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240205,
					"content": "I don't go easy on small monsters either!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240206
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7602403,
