						"pointId": 360700068
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 760240501,
					"content": "You're not sure what's going on, but you approach the little girl...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240502
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760240502,
					"content": "Watch out for those Weasel Thieves. They've been hanging out in Moleyvalley for a while now. If they get you, you'll become a person with no shadow, too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240503,
					"content": "Weasel Thieves? Where? Also, what do you mean, \"person with no shadow\"...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240504,
					"content": "Whoa! What's up with that machine? Are the Weasel Thieves using it to attack us?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240505,
					"content": "Those ones were raised by humans — might even be smarter than humans, too. That's how they chased all the big guys away.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240506,
					"content": "Now — and the big guys have tried and failed to do this before — you just have to <color=#00E1FFFF>remove the energy core</color>, and you're golden. They've never actually done it, though, so it can't be that easy.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240507,
					"content": "#Hmm, we can stop the Weasel Thieves by grabbing the energy core, right? C'mon, {NICKNAME}, why don't we give it a go?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240508,
					"content": "We can't just ignore something dangerous like that when there's a little kid running around.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240509,
					"content": "Seeing as it's the great Paimon asking, I could never refuse!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240510
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760240510,
					"content": "Just keep your head down here, okay, lil' miss? ... Oh, right. What's your name again?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240511,
					"content": "...Aren't you the \"littlest\" miss here? I don't get it... Whatever, I'm Auni, and you should call me \"Big Sis,\" littlest miss. It's only proper.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240512,
					"content": "#Uhm... Let's just leave the titles aside for now... Come on, {NICKNAME}. We've got Weasel Thieves to bring down a peg or two!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
