						"pointId": 360700097
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 760240601,
					"content": "I'm guessing the Weasel Thief Big Bosses are trying to copy the big guys and make the Moley family their flunkies.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240602,
					"content": "But just like how those big guys failed, they probably didn't get their way either. Those weasels have messed up Moleyvalley, and now the Moley family are hiding in a hole somewhere.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240603,
						760240605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240603,
					"content": "It's probably best not to expect too much from moles.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240604
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760240604,
					"content": "Yeah, they're just Sniffer Moles... and it's not like the Weasel Thieves don't already have super dangerous weapons! ...Come to think of it, it's crazy they even *have* those.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240607,
					"content": "Moleyvalley once again belongs to Grandpa Moley and his family. As we agreed, here's your Mora. Thanks for the help!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240608,
					"content": "Oh, yeah. Might as well give you this as well. Helka said fiction mustn't find its way into her booklet, or it'll start getting hard to tell truth from falsehood.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240609,
					"content": "I'm not sure it matters... Even false things contain some truth, don't they?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240610,
					"content": "#Anyway, I'll see you around, {NICKNAME}, Littlest Miss Paimon. I'll come find you again if the Weasel Thief Big Bosses try anything funny.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240611,
					"content": "#Hehe, looks like our reputation's a-growin', {NICKNAME}! Paimon really hopes those weasels don't try anything funny again. You take care, Auni!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240612,
					"content": "I will. Safe travels, you two!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760240605,
					"content": "They relied on humans for that as well.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240606
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760240606,
					"content": "Well, these are just Sniffer Moles, after all... And if we look at this differently, the Weasel Thieves only got their hands on dangerous machines because of humans. It's only right that humans should clean up the mess that other humans created!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760240607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
