			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 760241501,
					"content": "Ooh, look! It's the whole Moley family. Grandpa, Papa, Mama, Lil' Moley, Little Lil' Moley... and all the rest.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760241502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760241502,
					"content": "Oh, so they're Sniffer Moles! Wait, how do you tell them apart? They all look the same to Paimon.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760241503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760241503,
					"content": "By their personalities, of course! You'll understand if you get to know 'em.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760241504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760241504,
					"content": "But they all have the same bad habit of begging for stuff from humans. *sigh* Poor critters. If we went extinct, what would happen to them?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760241505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760241505,
					"content": "...Humans? Go extinct? While Sniffer Moles survive? H—How could that happen?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760241506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760241506,
					"content": "Big Sis Linnea says that animals go extinct for all sorts of reasons. That means humans can go extinct, too. How do you not know that, Littlest Miss Paimon?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760241507,
						760241509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760241507,
					"content": "I'd like to think I'll outlast the Sniffer Moles, at least...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760241508
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760241508,
					"content": "But that doesn't really answer Auni's question, does it? Hmm... Come to think of it, humans really are in a scary spot with all these threats out there...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760241512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760241512,
					"content": "Anyway, back on topic — what're we going to do about these Weasel Thieves now that we've found our moles?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760241513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760241513,
					"content": "If no one's got a better idea, let's just hand them over to The Flagship...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760241514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Auni"
				},
				{
					"id": 760241514,
					"content": "Treasure! Or is it a bribe in this situation? Eh, whatever. Since they're giving it to us, we might as well take it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760241515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760241515,
					"content": "#Well, they seem sorry, at least. Let's let 'em off the hook this time, {NICKNAME} — but not because they gave us treasure, of course!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760241509,
					"content": "They say that insects predate humans...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760241510
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760241510,
					"content": "And they'll probably still be around when we're gone.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760241511
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760241511,
					"content": "Wait, so humans are gonna lose to insects? ... Ugh, Paimon's kinda peeved by that!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760241512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
